  "cues": [
    {
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "A Binance engineer interviews for a job"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 2.36,
      "end_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "at another company."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 3.92,
      "end_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "First, he speaks with a recruiter."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 6.08,
      "end_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "Then he speaks with someone claiming to"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 8.04,
      "end_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "be the company's manager."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 9.72,
      "end_seconds": 11.52,
      "text": "He gets a test assignment and downloads"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 11.6,
      "end_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "it to his work computer."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 13.24,
      "end_seconds": 15.36,
      "text": "But the company doesn't exist."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 15.44,
      "end_seconds": 17.52,
      "text": "A few weeks later, his real employer"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 17.6,
      "end_seconds": 20.64,
      "text": "will lose more than six billion dollars."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 20.72,
      "end_seconds": 23.52,
      "text": "The trap looks convincing: the invitation comes"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 23.6,
      "end_seconds": 25.28,
      "text": "through a real job platform,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 25.36,
      "end_seconds": 27.04,
      "text": "the interviews are by video,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 27.08,
      "end_seconds": 28.64,
      "text": "and the recruiter even shows him her"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 28.96,
      "end_seconds": 31.6,
      "text": "account, with personal photos and videos."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 31.68,
      "end_seconds": 33.68,
      "text": "It all leads to one thing:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 33.76,
      "end_seconds": 35.2,
      "text": "running the code."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 35.28,
      "end_seconds": 36.8,
      "text": "As he sets up the assignment,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 36.88,
      "end_seconds": 38.8,
      "text": "malware runs alongside it."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 39.0,
      "end_seconds": 41.36,
      "text": "Security systems miss it, giving the attackers"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 41.44,
      "end_seconds": 44.16,
      "text": "access to a computer inside Binance."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 44.36,
      "end_seconds": 46.64,
      "text": "According to Binance's preliminary findings,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 46.72,
      "end_seconds": 48.4,
      "text": "they use that computer to reach two"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 48.48,
      "end_seconds": 50.24,
      "text": "more engineers' machines."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 50.52,
      "end_seconds": 52.24,
      "text": "Credentials found there give them access to"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 52.32,
      "end_seconds": 54.56,
      "text": "the system that approves transfers from Binance"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 54.64,
      "end_seconds": 57.28,
      "text": "wallets, allowing them to authorize transfers to"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 57.56,
      "end_seconds": 59.093,
      "text": "addresses they control."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 59.147,
      "end_seconds": 62.08,
      "text": "On October 29, crypto assets start moving"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 62.12,
      "end_seconds": 63.627,
      "text": "to those addresses."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 63.813,
      "end_seconds": 65.88,
      "text": "Security flags the large transfers."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 65.92,
      "end_seconds": 68.427,
      "text": "Binance halts ordinary withdrawals and,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 68.453,
      "end_seconds": 70.48,
      "text": "with its partners, tries to freeze the"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 70.56,
      "end_seconds": 71.8,
      "text": "stolen assets."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 71.84,
      "end_seconds": 73.56,
      "text": "But that isn't enough."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 73.6,
      "end_seconds": 76.16,
      "text": "Through the compromised system, the attackers manage"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 76.2,
      "end_seconds": 78.32,
      "text": "to give another program permission to move"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 78.48,
      "end_seconds": 80.56,
      "text": "crypto assets directly from a wallet on"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 80.64,
      "end_seconds": 81.64,
      "text": "Ethereum."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 81.68,
      "end_seconds": 84.32,
      "text": "That program no longer needs Binance's ordinary"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 84.4,
      "end_seconds": 85.72,
      "text": "withdrawal system."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 85.76,
      "end_seconds": 87.547,
      "text": "Binance has stopped that system,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 87.573,
      "end_seconds": 90.0,
      "text": "but the permission recorded on Ethereum remains"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 90.08,
      "end_seconds": 90.92,
      "text": "active."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 90.96,
      "end_seconds": 93.28,
      "text": "Revoking it requires a separate operation on"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 93.32,
      "end_seconds": 94.84,
      "text": "the blockchain itself."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 94.88,
      "end_seconds": 97.6,
      "text": "Turning off withdrawals on Binance's website cannot"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 97.76,
      "end_seconds": 99.16,
      "text": "cancel that permission."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 99.2,
      "end_seconds": 101.44,
      "text": "From the first transfers to the finalization"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 101.48,
      "end_seconds": 103.8,
      "text": "of the last transaction already sent,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 103.84,
      "end_seconds": 105.947,
      "text": "almost four hours pass."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 105.973,
      "end_seconds": 107.8,
      "text": "The permission is revoked later,"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 107.84,
      "end_seconds": 109.0,
      "text": "after midnight."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 109.04,
      "end_seconds": 110.96,
      "text": "The stolen crypto assets are valued at"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 111.04,
      "end_seconds": 114.28,
      "text": "about $6.34 billion."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 114.32,
      "end_seconds": 117.52,
      "text": "About $2.85 billion worth of those assets"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 117.64,
      "end_seconds": 119.573,
      "text": "is frozen or intercepted —"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 119.6,
      "end_seconds": 120.88,
      "text": "but that does not mean they have"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 120.96,
      "end_seconds": 122.12,
      "text": "been returned."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 122.16,
      "end_seconds": 123.84,
      "text": "Binance says it will cover the loss"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 123.88,
      "end_seconds": 125.387,
      "text": "with its own funds."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 125.413,
      "end_seconds": 128.2,
      "text": "The company he interviewed with never existed."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 128.24,
      "end_seconds": 130.0,
      "text": "His real employer had to face the"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 130.12,
